for failed queries.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/4630" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/4630/hovercard"&gt;#4630&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
